{"articleNo":"308629","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=308629&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [선발공고]2021-하계방학 생활관생 선발 공고 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.05.06","hit":"8190","attachments":[{"name":"2021학년도 하계방학 생활관생 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=308629&attachNo=100021"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\">하계방학 선발 공고문을 붙임과 같이 안내하오니, 주의사항에 유념하여 신청 및 등록하시기 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: dashed; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">오름관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">2, 3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">동 비일반실 연장거주신청서</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">1) 제출기한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: 04.30.(금) ~</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;05.10.(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">) 16:00</span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -21.5pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">2) 제출방법 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -21.5pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이메일제출</span><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">메일제목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">연장거주 신청</span></span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4) 메일주소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">:</span>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">kit_do</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 1.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">r</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">m1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: -28.6667px;\">※ 오름관 3동 장애인실은 방학운영&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: -28.6667px;\">제외로 연장거주 신청받지 않음</span><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -28.6667px;\"><font face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(16시까지 보낸 신청서만 유효하며 이후 발송건은 접수에서 제외됩니다.)</span></span></font></p><div style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px;\"><br></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"9178\"></div><p></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt; text-align: center;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(193, 193, 193); background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; text-indent: -21.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; FAQ<br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\">1. 1학기에 거주하던&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">호실</span>이 달라지나요?</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;☞ 호실 변동 있습니다.</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\">2. 공고문에 나온 신청 기간 말고는 신청을 못하나요?</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;☞</span><span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px;\">&nbsp;네, 신청기간 외에는 신청이 불가합니다.</span><br></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (<span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일반선발: 5.7.(금) 10시 ~ 5.10.(월) 16시</span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;추가선발: 5.24.(월) 10시 ~ 16시<span style=\"text-indent: -28.6667px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 21.5pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -21.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -21.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br style=\"font-family: 돋움; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; text-align: left;\">(개관&nbsp;기간&nbsp;변경)</span><br style=\"font-family: 돋움; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; text-align: left;\">하계방학&nbsp;입사일&nbsp;6.26.(토)&nbsp;14시부터&nbsp;가능합니다</span><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQVkhbAwgVQE4A8BWBT